      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I got a lack of good judgment",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Judgin' by the fact I got close to you (Oh, no)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Time should heal, but it doesn't",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Or maybe 'cause you still haven't told the truth (Oh, no)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "You know there's nothin' worse",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Than missin' the signs",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "'Cause you pulled the wool right over your eyes",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'll admit when I'm wrong",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "But this time, I'm right",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "I'm sorry but I'll never see your side",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Said she was a girl's girl, that's a lie",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Said she had my back but she had the knife",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I could never do it once and she did it twice",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And you wonder why",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "And you wonder why we're not alike",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
